{
  "key": 19966,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0979_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_D_Academy_Text_LectureDStudent",
      "en_US": [
        "I’ve rebuilt my team in Tansy’s\n",
        "Team Builder six times today.\r",
        "Seven’s the charm!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0979_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_D_Academy_Text_TeamBuilderPC",
      "en_US": "Tansy’s Team Builder booted up."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0979_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_D_Academy_Text_TeacherMenu",
      "en_US": "What shall we do?"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0979_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_D_Academy_Text_OptDemo",
      "en_US": "Demo Battle"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0979_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_D_Academy_Text_OptLecture",
      "en_US": "the Lecture"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0979_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_D_Academy_Text_OptBye",
      "en_US": "That’s All"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0979_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_D_Academy_Text_YarrowLecture0",
      "en_US": [
        "Yarrow: Training. The numbers\n",
        "behind the battles."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0979_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_D_Academy_Text_YarrowLecture1",
      "en_US": [
        "Every Pokémon has 510 Effort\n",
        "points to spend: 252 at most in\r",
        "one stat. Put them where the\n",
        "Pokémon needs them.\r",
        "In doubles, bulk matters more:\n",
        "two attackers come your way.\r",
        "Many trainers put more into HP\n",
        "than in singles."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0979_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_D_Academy_Text_YarrowLecture2",
      "en_US": [
        "A nature raises one stat ten\n",
        "percent and lowers another.\r",
        "Mints, or my Cilantro, change\n",
        "the nature’s effect.\r",
        "For a Trick Room team, lower its\n",
        "Speed on purpose: a\r",
        "Speed-lowering nature, and Speed\n",
        "IVs at zero."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0979_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_D_Academy_Text_YarrowLecture3",
      "en_US": [
        "Then the item. Sitrus Berry for\n",
        "staying power, Life Orb for raw\r",
        "damage, Focus Sash to survive a\n",
        "double attack, Assault Vest for\r",
        "special bulk.\r",
        "The carts in our Market sell all\n",
        "of it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0979_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_D_Academy_Text_TansyLecture0",
      "en_US": [
        "Tansy: Team building! Six\n",
        "Pokémon, three plans."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0979_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_D_Academy_Text_TansyLecture1",
      "en_US": [
        "In doubles you lead with two.\n",
        "Build pairs that work together:\r",
        "Fake out with a sweeper, a\n",
        "weather setter with its abuser.\r",
        "Give your team a second plan for\n",
        "when the first lead struggles."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0979_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_D_Academy_Text_TansyLecture2",
      "en_US": [
        "Check your weaknesses: if four\n",
        "of your six fear Rock Slide,\r",
        "that’s a problem.\r",
        "Bring Protect on almost\n",
        "everyone, and something to deal\r",
        "with Trick Room and Tailwind."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0979_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_D_Academy_Text_TansyLecture3",
      "en_US": [
        "That PC next to me? I made a\n",
        "Team Builder for it myself. Pick\r",
        "six, choose their moves, and it\n",
        "shows you your weaknesses and\r",
        "coverage. It keeps up to eight\n",
        "teams.\r",
        "Use it whenever you like: you\n",
        "don’t have to ask me!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0979_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_D_Academy_Text_DemoIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: A demonstration! A\n",
        "double battle, and we both use\r",
        "rentals, three each.\r",
        "My team shows off the lesson.\n",
        "Choose yours wisely!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0979_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_D_gGymChallengeIntroText",
      "en_US": "(missing text)"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0979_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_D_Academy_Text_DemoWon",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Wonderful! Here,\n",
        "you’ve earned it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0979_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_D_Academy_Text_RentalReturn",
      "en_US": [
        "Your own Pokémon are back with\n",
        "you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0979_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_D_Academy_Text_DemoLost",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Ha! Think about the\n",
        "lesson and try again."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0979_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_D_Academy_Text_EarnedBP",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} earned {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} BP!\n",
        "(Total: {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} BP)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0979_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_D_cv_unported",
      "en_US": [
        "(Canvas DS: this part of the game\n",
        "isn’t ported yet.)"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
